{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》主要演員包括：楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤、鄺潔楹等。</p><p>下周播出劇情講述，傅嘉莉將在醫院對林夏薇進行終極爆Seed大控訴，原本傷心得氣若游絲、企都企唔穩的她，當聽到林夏薇一再狡辯兼惡人先告</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:23:54.328860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T12:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:16.504051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:16.504051+00:00","content_hash":"5675bfe662cb8e015589caeb906789ef47dc8ea1ac8afc45e3e7d56ade55c5ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}